{"overview":"هارمون \"هارم\" راب جونیور خلبان پیشینی که به وکالت روی آورده است برای بخش JAG (دادستان دادگاه نظامی) ارتش کار می‌کند، شاخه حقوقی نخبه افسرانی که متهمان به جنایات نظامی را تحت تعقیب قرار داده و یا از آن‌ها دفاع می‌کنند. او از نزدیک با سرهنگ دوم سارا مکنزی همکاری می‌کند و با هم هر آنچه که برای یافتن حقیقت لازم است انجام می‌دهند.","tagline":"دفاع هرگز آرام نمی‌گیرد","overview_en":"Harmon \"Harm\" Rabb Jr. is a former pilot turned lawyer working for the military's JAG (Judge Advocate General) division, the elite legal wing of officers that prosecutes and defends those accused of military-related crimes. He works closely with Lt. Col. Sarah Mackenzie, and together they do what needs to be done to find the truth.","tagline_en":"The defense never rests.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":17,"y":2006,"poster":"/6h3C9Zmf26KqFBwPO0JAspD1NWz.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":22,"y":1995,"poster":"/f7UZ659kUTIEyWFCW1dg4Mgy84N.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":15,"y":1997,"poster":"/oTX7Ksx1ySfxIsqaqvIds4hrGwk.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":1997,"poster":"/ja2fxem49izv8U1vbmMeje8jjGA.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":1998,"poster":"/g4cimorad2a1EmFDFg25K7wRzNk.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":25,"y":1999,"poster":"/fyW8kFd30B8l9AvmTuRIG627iR9.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":24,"y":2000,"poster":"/2QVMqxHUVMnL9CLGfpedATZUV3q.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":24,"y":2001,"poster":"/rI6sqEU2arfT3aWbZnwyeCzXbTo.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":24,"y":2002,"poster":"/kN0OtMfApGmqwC9iNGs1SIbWrKr.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":23,"y":2003,"poster":"/kJMsIcyNgKeYe6iPWOC04IBciD6.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2004,"poster":"/i61V7FvkILEqSvaedP4E5JIu8Qs.jpg"}],"episodes":227,"crew":["دونالد پ بلیساریو"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"David James Elliott","role":"Harmon Rabb","photo":"/u71mHttq4ShuhoR5zuIzKR2i3YU.jpg"},{"name":"کاترین بل","role":"Sarah MacKenzie","photo":"/hziXYpU5nDWUAdoPZy6spHBH2pf.jpg"},{